<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Andover Bancorp raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Andover Bancorp raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Ryan, Beck said it raised its rating on Andover Bancorp Inc to strong buy from buy.</p>
<p>-- cited belief that future earnings per share &quot;should be significantly higher than originally estimated.&quot;</p>
<p>-- shares closed unchanged at 25-7/8 on Friday.</p>
</text>
